     "part_number": "MON-01",
     "description": "Gigabyte M32U 31.5in 4K monitor, stand removed, VESA 100x100 mounted (purchased, reference model). Origin: VESA mounting face centre (rear of VESA boss); screen faces -Y, X right, Z up. VESA centre is m32u_vesa_dz = 6.7 mm above the outline centre (= active-area centre).",
